./ * HRC244DS - Add support for most of HNDIO from VM/ESA
./ *
./ * This update adds the new DMSHDITP entry point to
./ * process the calls made from the HNDIO macro.
./ * 
./ * This update also adds DSECT mappings of all plists 
./ * and makes use of the new DEVSECT mapping of the User
./ * Interrupt Table entries.   
./ * 
./ * Associated with this update, the HNDINT MODULE will
./ * be deleted and this module will be moved into the
./ * resident CMS nucleus.
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITES:
./ * none
./ *
./ * HISTORY:
./ * 28-Mar-2026 WDENTON  Initial version for VM370CE V1 R1.2
./ *
./ R 00017000 00017100 $ 00017010 100
*        Reentrant, Nucleus Resident, Disabled                 HRC244DS 00017010
*        (Update HRC244DS removes HNDINT MODULE)               HRC244DS 00017110
./ I 00021000 $ 00021100
*        2. DMSHDITP - Entry point from HNDIO macro            HRC244DS 00021100
./ I 00027000 $ 00027100                                     
*        For HNDINT invocations, the plist is as follows:      HRC244DS 00027100
./ R 00030000 00031000 $ 00030100 100                                     
*            +---CL4                 Device name               HRC244DS 00030100
*            |   AL4                 Routine address           HRC244DS 00030200
*         +--+   XL2                 Device address            HRC244DS 00030100
*         |  |   CL1                 ASAP|WAIT                 HRC244DS 00030300
*         |  +---CL1                 C'C' = NOKEEP             HRC244DS 00030400
*         |                                                    HRC244DS 00030500
*         +---(subsequent handlers)                            HRC244DS 00030600 
./ I 00034000 $ 00034015 15                      
*        For HNDIO SET invocations, the plist is as follows:   HRC244DS 00034015
*                                                              HRC244DS 00034030
*                                                              HRC244DS 00034045
*        CL8'DMSHDITP'       SVC 204 entry point               HRC244DS 00034060
*        CL4'SET'            Function                          HRC244DS 00034075
*        CL4                 Device name                       HRC244DS 00034090
*        AL4                 Routine address                   HRC244DS 00034105
*        XL2                 Device address                    HRC244DS 00034120
*        XL1                 Processing Flag                   HRC244DS 00034135
*                            X'1... ....' -- SYSTEM=YES        HRC244DS 00034150
*                            X'.1.. ....' -- KEEP=YES          HRC244DS 00034165
*                            X'..1. ....' -- NOTIFY=ASAP       HRC244DS 00034180
*                            X'...1 ....' -- PERSIST=YES       HRC244DS 00034195
*        XL1                 Reserved                          HRC244DS 00034210
*        AL4                 INTBLOK address                   HRC244DS 00034325
*        AL4                 INTBLOK length                    HRC244DS 00034340
*        AL4                 User word                         HRC244DS 00034355
*        XL8                 Plist fence - X'FF'               HRC244DS 00034370
*                                                              HRC244DS 00034385
*        For HNDIO CLR invocations, the plist is as follows:   HRC244DS 00034400
*                                                              HRC244DS 00034415
*        CL8'DMSHDITP'       SVC 204 entry point               HRC244DS 00034430
*        CL4'CLR'            Function                          HRC244DS 00034445
*        CL4                 Device name                       HRC244DS 00034460
*        AL4                 CLRLIST value                     HRC244DS 00034475
*        XL8                 Plist fence - X'FF'               HRC244DS 00034490
./ R 00126000 00131000 $ 00126100 100
DMSHDI   CSECT ,                                               HRC244DS 00126100
         DC    CL8'DMSHDI'             Module name eyecatcher  HRC244DS 00126200
         DC    AL2(HDI@END-DMSHDI)     Module length           HRC244DS 00126300
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00126400
         ENTRY HNDINT                  HNDINT entry point      HRC244DS 00126500
HNDINT   DS    0H                      ...                     HRC244DS 00126600
         LR    R12,R15                 Set up permanent base   HRC244DS 00126700
         LA    R15,HNDINT-DMSHDI       ...                     HRC244DS 00126800
         SLR   R12,R15                 ...                     HRC244DS 00126900
         USING DMSHDI,R12              ...                     HRC244DS 00127000
         USING NUCON,0                 We use NUCON a lot      HRC244DS 00127100
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00127200
         XC    0(TEMPLEN,R13),0(R13)   Clear part of savearea  HRC244DS 00127400
./ I 00135000 $ 00135100 100
         USING HNDHEAD,R1                                      HRC244DS 00135100
         PUSH  USING                                           HRC244DS 00135200
./ R 00136000 $ 00136010
         CLC   @SET,HNDACTN   Is it 'SET'?                     HRC244DS 00136010
./ R 00138000 $ 00138010
         CLC   @CLR,HNDACTN   Is it 'CLR'?                     HRC244DS 00138010
./ R 00140000 $ 00140010
         CLC   @PURGE,HNDACTN If not, is it 'PURGE'            HRC244DS 00140010
./ R 00147000 $ 00147010
         LA    R2,HNDENTRY    Now let R2 be start of entries   HRC244DS 00147010
./ R 00149000 00151000 $ 00148100 1000
         USING HNDPLST,R3                                      HRC244DS 00148100
         LA    R4,HNDSIZE     Set R4 = HNDINT entry size       HRC244DS 00149100
         LA    R0,DEVSIZE     R0 = initial result size (1 entryHRC244DS 00150100
         CLC   HNDNAME,FENCE  Make sure entries are there      HRC244DS 00151100
./ I 00156000 $ 00156020 20
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00156020
*        Top of loop to count & validate HNDINT entries        HRC244DS 00156040
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00156060
./ R 00158000 00159000 $ 00158100 500
         A     R0,=A(DEVSIZE) Increment R0 for another entry   HRC244DS 00158100
LM1415   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00158600
         LM    R14,R15,HNDNAME Get dev name & handler addr     HRC244DS 00159100
./ R 00171000 $ 00171010 10
CLC4     DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00171010
         CLC   HNDFENCE,FENCE Look for fence after plist       HRC244DS 00171020
./ I 00172000 $ 00172100 10
*                                                              HRC244DS 00172100
*         End on initial pass thru HNDINT list                 HRC244DS 00172110
./ R 00180000 $ 00180010
         LA    R7,HNDSIZE(,R2) Set up R7,R8,&R9 fr outer loop  HRC244DS 00180010
./ R 00187000 $ 00187010 10
CLC37    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00187010
         CLC   HNDNAME,0(R7)  Check the symbolic names         HRC244DS 00187020        
./ I 00190000 $ 00190100 50
         DROP  R3             Done with HNDPLST                HRC244DS 00190100
         SPACE 3                                               HRC244DS 00190150
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00190200
*        HNDINT & HNDIO join up here to build DEVSECT table    HRC244DS 00190250
*        Registers are:                                        HRC244DS 00190300
*        R0 = space needed for new entries                     HRC244DS 00190350
*        R1 = HNDHEAD address                                  HRC244DS 00190400
*        R2 = First new HDRPLST                                HRC244DS 00190450
*        R8 = Length of each HDRPLST entry                     HRC244DS 00190500
*        R9 = Last new HDRPLST                                 HRC244DS 00190550
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00190600
./ R 00193000 $ 00193010
         LA    R4,DEVSIZE     Let R4 = 32 now (R8 still = 12)  HRC244DS 00193010
./ R 00196000 $ 00196010
         CLC   @CLR,HNDACTN   Is this a 'CLR' call?            HRC244DS 00196010
./ R 00205000 $ 00205010
         AR    R5,R4          plus 32 = # of bytes in old tbl  HRC244DS 00205010
./ I 00233000 $ 00233050 50
*                                                              HRC244DS 00233050
         USING DEVSECT,R3                                      HRC244DS 00233100
         USING HNDPLST,R7                                      HRC244DS 00233150
./ R 00236000 $ 00236010 10
CLC37A   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00236010
         CLC   DEVNAME,HNDNAME New name matches old name?      HRC244DS 00236020
./ R 00241000 00244000 $ 00241100 200
         DROP  R3                                              HRC244DS 00241100
         USING DEVSECT,R15                                     HRC244DS 00241300
STNEW1   DS    0H                 (joins here from REPLACE)    HRC244DS 00241500
         XC    DEVSECT(DEVSIZE),DEVSECT Clear the entry        HRC244DS 00241700
         TM    MYFLAGS,DEVHNDIO   Is this a HNDIO call?        HRC244DS 00241900
         BO    STHNDIO            ..yes, fill from that plist  HRC244DS 00242100
*                                                              HRC244DS 00242300
         MVC   DEVADDR,HNDDEVAD   Device address into entry    HRC244DS 00242500
         MVC   DEVNAME,HNDNAME    Device name into entry       HRC244DS 00242700
         MVC   DEVSLIH,HNDRTNAD   Handler addr into entry      HRC244DS 00242900
         CLI   HNDWHEN,C'A'       Is it 'A' for ASAP?          HRC244DS 00243100
./ R 00246000 00247000 $ 00246100 200
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVASAP    Set flag for FLIH use        HRC244DS 00246100
ASAPOK   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00246300
         CLI   HNDKEEP,C'K'       Is it 'K' for KEEP?          HRC244DS 00246500
./ R 00249000 $ 00249010 30
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVKEEP    Set flag for FLIH            HRC244DS 00249010
         DROP  R7                 (done with HNDPLST)          HRC244DS 00249040
*                                                              HRC244DS 00249070
STHNDIO  DS    0H                 Build new one from HNDIO     HRC244DS 00249100
         USING SETPLST,R7         the SET plist                HRC244DS 00249130
         MVC   DEVADDR,SETDEVAD   Set the Device Address       HRC244DS 00249160
         MVC   DEVNAME,SETDNAME   Set the Device Name          HRC244DS 00249190
         MVC   DEVSLIH,SETRTNAD   Set the Interrupt Handler    HRC244DS 00249220
         TM    SETPFLAG,SETASAP   NOTIFY=ASAP?                 HRC244DS 00249250
         BNO   *+8                ..no, skip                   HRC244DS 00249280
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVASAP    ..yes, set flag for FLIH     HRC244DS 00249310
         TM    SETPFLAG,SETKEEP   KEEP=YES?                    HRC244DS 00249340
         BNO   *+8                ..no, skip                   HRC244DS 00249470
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVKEEP    ..yes, set flag for FLIH     HRC244DS 00249500
         MVC   DEVUWORD,SETUWORD  Set the User Word            HRC244DS 00249530
         DROP  R7                                              HRC244DS 00249560
./ I 00268000 $ 00268100 50
         POP   USING                                           HRC244DS 00268100
         USING IOSECT,R10                                      HRC244DS 00268150
         USING DEVSECT,R3                                      HRC244DS 00268200
         USING HNDPLST,R7                                      HRC244DS 00268250
*                                                              HRC244DS 00268300
./ I 00273000 $ 00273100 50
ERR11    DS    0H             Return RC=11 Bad CLR plist       HRC244DS 00273100
         LA    R15,11                                          HRC244DS 00273150
         B     RETURN                                          HRC244DS 00273200
./ R 00283000 $ 00283010 10
CLC37B   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00283010
         CLC   DEVNAME,HNDNAME New name matches old name?      HRC244DS 00283020
./ R 00305000 $ 00305010 10
CLC37C   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00305010
         CLC   DEVNAME,HNDNAME New name matches old name?      HRC244DS 00305020
./ R 00312000 $ 00312010 10
ZREPLACE DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00312010
         XC    DEVSECT(DEVSIZE),DEVSECT Clear the entry        HRC244DS 00312020
./ R 00320000 $ 00320010
         MVC   0(DEVSIZE,R6),DEVSECT   Move entry to top       HRC244DS 00320010
./ R 00341000 $ 00341010 10
CHECK    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00341010
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVKEEP     Is KEEP flag set?           HRC244DS 00341020
./ R 00343000 $ 00343010
         XC    DEVSECT(DEVSIZE),DEVSECT Clear the entry        HRC244DS 00343010
./ R 00349000 00350000 $ 00348803 2
         EJECT ,                                               HRC244DS 00348803
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348805
*                            *----------*                   *  HRC244DS 00348807
*  Entry Point -             * DMSHDITP *                   *  HRC244DS 00348809
*                            *----------*                   *  HRC244DS 00348811
*                                                           *  HRC244DS 00348813
*  Function - Entry point for HNDIO plists and validates    *  HRC244DS 00348815
*             the HNDIO plist prior to joining HNDINT code  *  HRC244DS 00348817
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348819
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00348821
DMSHDITP DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00348823
         USING DMSHDITP,R15                                    HRC244DS 00348825
         LR    R12,R15                                         HRC244DS 00348827
         LA    R15,DMSHDITP-DMSHDI                             HRC244DS 00348829
         SLR   R12,R15                                         HRC244DS 00348831
         DROP  R15                                             HRC244DS 00348833
         USING DMSHDI,R12                                      HRC244DS 00348835
         USING NUCON,0                                         HRC244DS 00348837
         XC    0(TEMPLEN,R13),0(R13)                           HRC244DS 00348841
         USING TEMP,R13                                        HRC244DS 00348845
         ST    R14,JS14       Save return address              HRC244DS 00348847
         ST    R1,JS01        And save plist pointer           HRC244DS 00348849
         USING HNDHEAD,R1     addressing for plist head        HRC244DS 00348851
         SR    R15,R15        Initialize ERRCODE to zero       HRC244DS 00348853
         ST    R15,ERRCODE    ....                             HRC244DS 00348855
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00348857
         L     R10,AIOSECT    Get IOSECT address               HRC244DS 00348859
         USING IOSECT,R10                                      HRC244DS 00348861
         LA    R2,HNDENTRY    Point to plist detaile           HRC244DS 00348863
         CLC   @SET,HNDACTN   Is it SET?                       HRC244DS 00348865
         BE    IOSET          BE IF YES, HANDLE 'SET'.         HRC244DS 00348867
         CLC   @CLR,HNDACTN   Is it CLR?                       HRC244DS 00348869
         BE    IOCLR          BE IF YES, HANDLE 'CLR'.         HRC244DS 00348871
         B     ERR01          ERROR IF NO LEGAL CALL.          HRC244DS 00348873
*                                                              HRC244DS 00348875
IOSET    DS    0H             Handle HNDIO SET                 HRC244DS 00348877
         USING SETPLST,R2                                      HRC244DS 00348879
         LA    R7,DEVSIZE     Start out size for one           HRC244DS 00348881
*                             entry-use as collector for       HRC244DS 00348883
*                             how much storage to get for      HRC244DS 00348885
*                             new USRIOTBL                     HRC244DS 00348887
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00348889
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348891
*  Check for device name of zero or blanks, and routine     *  HRC244DS 00348893
*  address not properly aligned.                            *  HRC244DS 00348895
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348897
         ICM   R5,15,SETDNAME Get device name and test         HRC244DS 00348899
         BZ    ERR11          Nothing there...error            HRC244DS 00348901
         CL    R5,BLNKNAME    Is the name all blanks?          HRC244DS 00348903
         BZ    ERR11          Blanks aren't good!              HRC244DS 00348905
         L     R6,SETRTNAD    Get routine address              HRC244DS 00348907
         N     R6,ONE         Check lowest bit                 HRC244DS 00348909
         BNZ   ERR01          Error if it was odd-numbered     HRC244DS 00348911
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00348913
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348915
*  Set up to join up with code common with HNDINT above     *  HRC244DS 00348917
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348919
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00348921
         LR    R0,R7          R0 = size of new table entries   HRC244DS 00348923
*                             R1 = HNDHEAD address             HRC244DS 00348925
*                             R2 = First new HDRPLST           HRC244DS 00348927
*        LA    R8,SETSIZE     R8 = Length of each plist entry  HRC244DS 00348929
*        LA    R9,0(R8,R2)    R9 = Last new HDRPLST            HRC244DS 00348931
*                                                              HRC244DS 00348932
         OI    MYFLAGS,DEVHNDIO   Mark as a HNDIO call?        HRC244DS 00348933
         B     PLISTOK            and join with HNDINT above   HRC244DS 00348935
         DROP  R2                                              HRC244DS 00348937
         SPACE 3                                               HRC244DS 00348939
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348941
*  That leaves the HNDIO CLR processing.  Can't share much  *  HRC244DS 00348943
*  with HNDINT because of the CLRLIST option                *  HRC244DS 00348945
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00348947
IOCLR    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00348949
         USING CLRPLST,R2                                      HRC244DS 00348951
         ICM   R3,15,AUSRITBL Are there any old entries?       HRC244DS 00348953
         BE    ERR03           ..no, return RC=3               HRC244DS 00348955
         L     R5,AUSRILST    Get addr of last table entry     HRC244DS 00348957
*                                                              HRC244DS 00348959
         ICM   R7,15,CLRDNAME Is DEVNAME specified?            HRC244DS 00348961
         BZ    TRYCLIST       ..no, try CLRLIST                HRC244DS 00348963
         LA    R8,LR15E       Set retaddr from CLR routine     HRC244DS 00348965
         LR    R4,R3          Copy USRIOTBL start              HRC244DS 00348967
         B     LOCHNDLR       Join common routine              HRC244DS 00348969
*                                                              HRC244DS 00348971
TRYCLIST DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00348973
         ICM   R6,15,CLRCLIST Get CLRLIST address              HRC244DS 00348975
         BZ    ERR11          Not there... return RC=11        HRC244DS 00348977
         LA    R8,STRTLIST    Prepare to loop to here          HRC244DS 00348979
STRTLIST DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00348981
         CLC   0(4,R6),FENCE  End of CLRLIST?                  HRC244DS 00348983
         BE    LR15E          ..yes, finished.                 HRC244DS 00348985
         ICM   R7,15,0(R6)    Get first device name to CLR     HRC244DS 00348987
         BZ    ERR11          All zero, return RC=11           HRC244DS 00348989
         ICM   R3,15,AUSRITBL Get a fresh copy of USRIOTBL     HRC244DS 00348991
         BZ    ERR03          ..disappeared somehow            HRC244DS 00348993
         LR    R4,R3          Copy USRIOTBL start              HRC244DS 00348995
*                                                              HRC244DS 00348999
*        Locate the matching AUSRITBL entry                    HRC244DS 00349001
LOCHNDLR DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349003
         USING DEVSECT,R4                                      HRC244DS 00349005
         CL    R7,BLNKNAME    Name all blanks?                 HRC244DS 00349007
         BE    ERR11          Blanks aren't good               HRC244DS 00349009
         C     R7,DEVNAME     Does device name match?          HRC244DS 00349011
         BE    CLRIT          Yes...clear it from the USRIOTBL HRC244DS 00349013
         CR    R4,R5          We past the end of the USRIOTBL  HRC244DS 00349015
         BE    ERR03          Yes...then we're done            HRC244DS 00349017
         LA    R4,DEVSIZE(R4) Bump to next entry in USRIOTBL   HRC244DS 00349019
         B     LOCHNDLR       And try the next one             HRC244DS 00349021
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00349023
*  A matching device name was found in the USRIOTBL         *  HRC244DS 00349025
*-----------------------------------------------------------*  HRC244DS 00349027
CLRIT    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349029
         LA    R11,DEVSIZE   Size of an entry                  HRC244DS 00349031
         CR    R4,R5         Last entry to be released?        HRC244DS 00349033
         BNE   CLRMOVE       No; move rest of entries up       HRC244DS 00349035
         LR    R9,R4         Copy location to release          HRC244DS 00349037
         B     RELENTRY      And release the last entry        HRC244DS 00349039
CLRMOVE  DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349041
         LA    R9,DEVSIZE(R4)     Point to next entry          HRC244DS 00349043
         MVC   0(DEVSIZE,R4),0(R9)  Move following entry to    HRC244DS 00349045
*                            fill the "dead" entry             HRC244DS 00349047
         CR    R9,R5         Last entry moved?                 HRC244DS 00349049
         BE    RELENTRY      Yes...drop the dead one...        HRC244DS 00349051
         LA    R9,DEVSIZE(R9) Bump to next entries             HRC244DS 00349053
         LA    R4,DEVSIZE(R4)                                  HRC244DS 00349055
         B     CLRMOVE       And repeat                        HRC244DS 00349057
*                                                              HRC244DS 00349059
RELENTRY DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349061
         LA    R0,7(,R11)    Figure dwords to release          HRC244DS 00349063
         SRL   R0,3          ...                               HRC244DS 00349065
         DMSFRET DWORDS=(0),LOC=(1),TYPCALL=BALR  release last HRC244DS 00349067
         C     R11,IONTABL    Last surviving entry deleted?    HRC244DS 00349069
         BNE   CLRPTRS        No; others survive               HRC244DS 00349071
         XC    AUSRILST,AUSRILST  Zero out last entry pointer  HRC244DS 00349073
         XC    AUSRITBL,AUSRITBL  Zero out USRIOTBL pointer    HRC244DS 00349075
         XC    IONTABL,IONTABL    Zero out size of USRIOTBL    HRC244DS 00349077
         B     CLRITRET                                        HRC244DS 00349079
CLRPTRS  DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349081
         SR    R5,R11         Subtract one entry               HRC244DS 00349083
         ST    R5,AUSRILST    Point to the new last entry      HRC244DS 00349085
         L     R9,IONTABL     Get size of old table            HRC244DS 00349087
         SR    R9,R11         Get new size                     HRC244DS 00349089
         ST    R9,IONTABL     Store new size                   HRC244DS 00349091
CLRITRET DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00349093
         LA    R6,4(R6)       Bump CLRLIST pointer             HRC244DS 00349095
         BR    R8             Return                           HRC244DS 00349097
         DROP  R2,R4                                           HRC244DS 00349099
         SPACE 3                                               HRC244DS 00349101
*        CONSTANTS ...                                         HRC244DS 00349103
./ I 00354500 $ 00354600 50
@SET     DC    CL4'SET'                                        HRC244DS 00354600
@CLR     DC    CL4'CLR'                                        HRC244DS 00354650
@PURGE   DC    CL4'PURGE'                                      HRC244DS 00354700
BLNKNAME DC    CL4' '                                          HRC244DS 00354750
./ R 00369000 $ 00369010
         DC    A(DEVSIZE)     Entry size (for BXLE)            HRC244DS 00369010
./ R 00371000 00374000 $ 00371050 50
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00371050
MYFLAGS  DC    X'00'          Various flags                    HRC244DS 00371100
*                                                              HRC244DS 00371100
         DS    0D                                              HRC244DS 00371100
TEMPLEN  EQU   *-TEMP                                          HRC244DS 00371100
         EJECT ,                                               HRC244DS 00371150
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00371200
*  Internal DSECTs....                                         HRC244DS 00371250
*------------------------------------------------------------- HRC244DS 00371300
         SPACE 1                                               HRC244DS 00371350
HNDHEAD  DSECT ,                  Common heading               HRC244DS 00371400
HNDCMND  DS    CL8                Command name                 HRC244DS 00371450
HNDACTN  DS    CL4                SET | CLR                    HRC244DS 00371500
HNDENTRY EQU   *                  First HNDINT entry           HRC244DS 00371550
HNDHEADL EQU   *-HNDHEAD          Heading length               HRC244DS 00371600
         SPACE 2                                               HRC244DS 00371650
HNDPLST  DSECT ,                  HNDINT Plist entry mapping   HRC244DS 00371700
HNDNAME  DS    CL4                Device name                  HRC244DS 00371750
HNDRTNAD DS    AL4                Interrupt handler            HRC244DS 00371800
HNDDEVAD DS    XL2                Device address               HRC244DS 00371850
HNDWHEN  DS    CL1                Asap | Wait                  HRC244DS 00371900
HNDKEEP  DS    CL1                Keep                         HRC244DS 00371950
HNDSIZE  EQU   *-HNDPLST                                       HRC244DS 00372000
HNDFENCE DS    XL4                                             HRC244DS 00372050
HNDTOT   EQU   *-HNDPLST                                       HRC244DS 00372100
         SPACE 2                                               HRC244DS 00372150
SETPLST  DSECT ,                  HNDIO SET Plist mapping      HRC244DS 00372200
SETDNAME DS    CL4                Device name                  HRC244DS 00372250
SETRTNAD DS    AL4                Interrupt handler            HRC244DS 00372300
SETDEVAD DS    XL2                Device address               HRC244DS 00372350
SETPFLAG DS    XL1                Flags                        HRC244DS 00372400
SETSYST  EQU   X'80'              X....... SYSTEM=YES          HRC244DS 00372450
SETKEEP  EQU   X'40'              .X...... KEEP=YES            HRC244DS 00372500
SETASAP  EQU   X'20'              ..X..... NOTIFY=ASAP         HRC244DS 00372550
